  "description": "Slack alerting sink for SinkSharp. Posts Error/Critical log events to a Slack channel via an Incoming Webhook — no OAuth, no bot token. Pair it with a per-sink minimum level so only what someone needs to see right now reaches the channel.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
